#: includes/class-gf-zero-spam-addon.php:461
msgid "A list of forms and the number of spam entries since the last report."
msgstr "前回のレポート以降のスパムエントリのフォーム一覧と件数。"

#: includes/class-gf-zero-spam-addon.php:462
msgid ""
